        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.668,
            0.065,
            0.834,
            0.081
          ],
          "content": "Perimeter and Area"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.12,
            0.295,
            0.141
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Matha Pachchi!"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.1,
            0.152,
            0.849,
            0.245
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_4_image_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.252,
            0.76,
            0.39
          ],
          "content": "Akshi and Toshi start running along the rectangular tracks as shown in the figure. Akshi runs along the outer track and completes 5 rounds. Toshi runs along the inner track and completes 7 rounds. Now, they are wondering who ran more. Find out who ran the longer distance."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.389,
            0.848,
            0.53
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_4_image_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.535,
            0.835,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": "Each track is a rectangle. Akshi’s track has length 70 m and breadth 40 m. Running one complete round on this track would cover 220 m, i.e., 2 × (70 + 40) m 220 m. This is the distance covered by Akshi in one round."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.638,
            0.302,
            0.66
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.668,
            0.75,
            0.688
          ],
          "content": "1. Find out the total distance Akshi has covered in 5 rounds."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.694,
            0.832,
            0.736
          ],
          "content": "2. Find out the total distance Toshi has covered in 7 rounds. Who ran a longer distance?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.742,
            0.612,
            0.762
          ],
          "content": "3. Think and mark the positions as directed—"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.766,
            0.829,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": "a. Mark ‘A’ at the point where Akshi will be after she ran 250 m."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.79,
            0.83,
            0.81
          ],
          "content": "b. Mark ‘B’ at the point where Akshi will be after she ran 500 m."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.814,
            0.833,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": "c. Now, Akshi ran 1000 m. How many full rounds has she finished running around her track? Mark her position as ‘C’."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.859,
            0.828,
            0.88
          ],
          "content": "d. Mark ‘X’ at the point where Toshi will be after she ran 250 m."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.883,
            0.828,
            0.904
          ],
          "content": "e. Mark ‘Y’ at the point where Toshi will be after she ran 500 m."
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.885,
